{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_33970","headline":"所居首夏水木尤清适然有作 · 皮日休","name":"所居首夏水木尤清适然有作","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"病来无事草堂空，昼水休闻十二筒。\n桂静似逢青眼客，松闲如见绿毛翁。\n潮期暗动庭泉碧，梅信微侵地障红。\n尽日枕书慵起得，被君犹自笑从公。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"皮日休","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_33970.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_33970","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}